      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "An Output's Frame port is its finished picture, and it cables on like any other. The first Output draws a tunnel flying through a checkerboard; the second folds that frame through a Kaleidoscope. A second Output is how one patch feeds a second screen, a deck of the mixer, or a send of its own \u2014 drag the Kaleidoscope's Segments."
        }
      },
